# VoiceOver reads a conversation as it shows: after scrolling up through a long
# conversation and back, a question still reads before its turn's folded work
# and its answer, however the list reused its rows. The list is a scroll area
# whose vertical scroll bar says where it is.
# iOS: HistoryUITests, TurnUITests (reading position)
fixture /reading-conversation/reading-history
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Reading conversation" 20000
expect "Answer 35 ends here." 20000
expect 作業しました after "*Reading question 35:*"
expect "Answer 35 ends here." after "*Reading question 35:*"
expect_scrolled この会話 0.99 1 10000
scroll この会話 -120
expect_scrolled この会話 0 0.98 10000
scroll この会話 -300
scroll この会話 120
scroll この会話 2000
expect_scrolled この会話 0.99 1 10000
expect 作業しました after "*Reading question 35:*"
expect "Answer 35 ends here." after "*Reading question 35:*"
dump scrolled-back
